  "description": "As a professor of English Literature, strict but capable I-Hyeon is both admired and feared by his students. He's surprised to discover his love for poetry is shared by one of them, the quiet yet arresting Nam-U. Drawn to her despite a painful past, can their love remain strong when faced with the new challenges that lie ahead...? \n\n(Source: Tappytoon, edited)",
